  "title": "Saga Communications, Inc. Reports 1st Quarter 2026 Results",
  "summary": "GROSSE POINTE FARMS, Mich., May 07, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Saga Communications, Inc. (Nasdaq - SGA) (the “Company” or “Saga”) today reported that net revenue decreased 5.6% to $22.9 million for the quarter ended March 31, 2026 compared to $24.2 million for the same period last year.",
